   "reasoning_content": "The user wants me to fix a bug in an Android project related to link truncation in a \"select text view\". The bug is that long links in comments are truncated with '...' and when you select text, it doesn't include the whole link.\n\nLet me start by understanding the codebase structure and finding the relevant code that handles link display and text selection.\n",
